WEBVTT

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.660
Something rare is happening right now.

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.800
A tool that used to be available only to
studios, large teams, and people

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:13.780
with years of technical experience is now
in everyone's hands.

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:19.000
Today, one person can turn a thought into
an entire world without a camera,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.900
a film crew, or complicated software.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.540
What matters is what you can create with
it.

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:27.230
And right now is the best time to learn.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:52.860
Hi, I'm Adil. I've been working as a
creative at Higgsfield for a year, and

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.190
in that time I've made more than 500
videos.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:00.960
Before that, I was a bartender with zero
experience in content creation.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.160
I had never even held a camera.

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:07.320
The goal of this course is to help anyone
learn the creative skills of the

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:09.820
future and use them in their own life.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:14.220
AI Today is a giant sandbox with almost
limitless possibilities.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:18.610
You can create a character, shoot a scene,
make an ad, or build an entire

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:21.230
world and see your idea on screen within
minutes.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.440
What today's models can already do is
genuinely impressive.

00:01:25.440 --> 00:01:28.420
And the best way to understand what's
possible isn't to watch from the

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.780
sidelines, it's to start creating for
yourself.

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:36.260
In this course, we'll go from your first
simple prompt to videos you can

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:40.490
actually use. You'll learn how to work
with supercomputer, turn a product

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:45.640
photo into an ad, create your own
characters and locations, and build a

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:49.220
short story. We'll also cover how to
improve results without wasting

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:53.940
credits. I'll show you each step, you'll
try it yourself, and together we'll

00:01:53.940 --> 00:01:57.560
turn random generations into deliberate
creative choices.

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:58.560
See you in the first lesson.
